om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note OmegaGpuLaunch: ABI offsets are asserted in omega_api_views_rest.h.
fn arlaunch q view ulong 16 y edit uint 20 to ulong
for i ulong 20
put y i 0
end
put y 0 uint get q 0
put y 1 uint shr get q 0 32
put y 2 uint get q 1
put y 3 uint get q 2
put y 4 uint get q 3
put y 5 uint get q 4
put y 6 uint get q 5
put y 8 uint get q 6
put y 9 uint shr get q 6 32
put y 10 uint get q 7
put y 11 uint shr get q 7 32
put y 12 uint get q 8
put y 14 uint get q 9
put y 15 uint shr get q 9 32
put y 16 uint get q 10
put y 17 uint get q 11
put y 18 uint get q 12
ret 0
end
